    {
      "text": "Forest plot of sensitivity and specificity with 95% confidence intervals for 3 studies in children: cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) with a microbiological reference standard. Sensitivity ranges from 0.67 to 1.00 where estimable and specificity from 0.91 to 1.00.",
